/// playbook-api application configuration — the platform codebase deployed to
/// the Playbook Systems DO account (digital_ocean_account = "playbook" in
/// env/apps/playbook-api/config.pkl), serving only the playbook tenant.
///
/// Load balancer managed via doctl (create at WS2 of the account split):
///   Name: playbook-api-lb
///   Hostname: api.plybk.us
///   Certificate: TBD — uploaded to the playbook DO account when provisioned
///
/// No javaAgent yet: the New Relic account decision for Playbook Systems is
/// pending (WS3 of the account split).

module playbookApi

appName = "playbook-api"
appPort = 9300
webMemory = "4400Mi"
